#: views/view.settings.php:56
msgid ""
"<strong>Disabled</strong>: Hosts defined in /etc/hosts are not added to "
"Trusted Zone except localhost."
msgstr "<strong>停用</strong>：除了 localhost 之外，/etc/hosts 中定義的主機不會被加入信任區域。"

#: views/view.settings.php:45
msgid ""
"<strong>Disabled</strong>: This service will be stopped and Intrusion "
"Detection will not run on boot. Intrusion Detection will be stopped as well."
msgstr "<strong>停用</strong>：此服務將被停止，且入侵偵測不會在開機時執行。入侵偵測也會被停止。"

#: views/view.settings.php:55
msgid ""
"<strong>Enabled</strong>: All hosts defined are added to the Trusted Zone "
"(default)"
msgstr "<strong>啟用</strong>：所有已定義的主機都會被加入信任區域（預設）"

#: views/view.settings.php:49
msgid ""
"<strong>Enabled</strong>: Automatically synchronize IPs from specific "
"firewall zones to the whitelist. E.g: When you add to a trusted zone, local "
"or otherwise, they will be added to the Intrusion Detection whitelist."
msgstr ""
"<strong>啟用</strong>：自動將特定防火牆區域的 IP 同步至白名單。例如：當您新增至信任區域（本機或其他）時，它們會被加入入侵偵測白名單。"

#: views/view.settings.php:44
msgid "<strong>Enabled</strong>: This service will be started on boot."
msgstr "<strong>啟用</strong>：此服務將在開機時啟動。"

#: views/view.shortcuts.php:6
msgid ""
"<strong>Important Warning!</strong> If you are in a hosted environment (for "
"example, AWS) and you enable this, you may be inadvertently allowing other "
"hosted clients unrestricted access to your machine! Please use common sense "
"to make sure that you are only allowing known trusted networks."
msgstr ""
"<strong>重要警告！</strong> 如果您處於託管環境（例如 AWS）並啟用此功能，可能會無意中允許其他託管使用者端不受限制地存取您的機器！請運用常識，確保只允許已知的信任網路。"

#: views/view.settings.php:50
msgid ""
"<strong>Legacy</strong>: Intrusion Detection whitelist will work like in the "
"past with no automated synchronization to the whitelist."
msgstr "<strong>舊版</strong>：入侵偵測白名單將如以往般運作，不會自動同步至白名單。"

#: views/view.interfaces.php:11
msgid ""
"A 'Trusted' interface means that <strong>no filtering</strong> will be "
"applied to any traffic arriving at that interface. Newly discovered "
"interfaces are set to this zone so they can be configured correctly without "
"interfering with existing traffic."
msgstr ""
"「信任」介面表示到達該介面的任何流量將<strong>不會被過濾</strong>。新發現的介面會設定為此區域，以便在不干擾現有流量的情況下正確設定。"

#: Firewall.class.php:580
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A network interface that is assigned to the 'Trusted' zone has been "
"detected. This is a misconfiguration. To ensure your system is protected "
"from attacks, please change the default zone of interface '%s'."
msgstr "偵測到一個被指派至「信任」區域的網路介面。這是錯誤設定。為確保您的系統免受攻擊，請變更介面「%s」的預設區域。"

#: Firewall.class.php:570
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A new, unconfigured, network interface has been detected. Please assign "
"interface '%s' to a zone."
msgstr "偵測到一個新的、未設定的網路介面。請將介面「%s」指派至一個區域。"

