msgstr "您所做的任何變更都會被儲存，但直到防火牆啟動後才會生效。"

#: views/view.blocked.php:33
msgid ""
"Any hosts in this section have been classified as an attacker by Fail2Ban's "
"SIP jail. All traffic from them will be ignored for 30 minutes after they "
"were classified as malicious."
msgstr "此區段中的任何主機已被 Fail2Ban 的 SIP 監獄分類為攻擊者。在它們被分類為惡意之後，來自它們的所有流量將被忽略 30 分鐘。"

#: views/view.blocked.php:19
msgid ""
"Any hosts in this section have been classified as an attacker. All traffic "
"from them will be ignored until they cease attempting to contact the server "
"for more than 24 hours."
msgstr "此區段中的任何主機已被分類為攻擊者。來自它們的所有流量將被忽略，直到它們停止嘗試連絡伺服器超過 24 小時。"

#: views/view.blocked.php:7
msgid ""
"Any hosts in this section have been rate limited, because they have sent too "
"much data to this machine without successfully registering."
msgstr "此區段中的任何主機已受到速率限制，因為它們在未經成功登錄的情況下傳送了過多資料到此機器。"

#: Zones.class.php:12
msgid ""
"Any incoming network packets are rejected. Note that this zone still accepts "
"RTP traffic, but no other ports are listening by default. You rarely want to "
"use this."
msgstr "任何傳入的網路封包都會被拒絕。請注意，此區域仍接受 RTP 流量，但預設沒有其他連接埠在監聽。您很少會想使用這個。"

